Subject: [PATCH] fix(provider): send only changed fields on update

Update sent every planned attribute and cleared null ones, so an
unrelated change also wrote fields the server refuses. The OSS build
rejects any enterprise property in a patch, even null: a domain update
failed on directoryId, an imported OIDC directory on memberTenantId.
Compare the plan with prior state and send only attributes that differ,
plus write-only values set in config. Adoption has no prior state and
still writes every mutable field. Skip the request if nothing remains.

